 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The supper on the table and the lamps were burning low",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 8.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He knelt down with a basin, it was time for him to go",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 8.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He washed the dust from every foot, the doubter and the proud",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 8.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And then he spoke so gently, though his heart was crying loud",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 9.57,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A new commandment I give you: love one another",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 11.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "As I have loved you, so you must love one another",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 10.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "By this everyone will know that you are my disciples",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 10.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "If you have love for one another",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 12.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not just the easy neighbors, not just the ones we choose",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 13.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not just when love is simple and there's nothing much to lose",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 11.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The towel and the basin, the bread passed hand to hand",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 11.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the way he loved us, this is his command",
